  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now that avatar rankings are being calculated server side it would be nice to see both platform's avatar ranking when look at stats or above their head.\n\nMany people run events on VRChat and to help things run smoothly enforce poor or better avatar rankings.  Currently you can only see the ranking of the platform you using which makes it impossible to try to enforce avatar rankings on both sides.  Being able to see quest ranking while on PC would help also enforce quest rankings this helping their performance as many quest users have issues with crashing during large instances.",
